# Rimvio product agent roles

**SSOT:** `lib/workstream/resolve-rimvio-agent-capability-role.ts` · Judgment Chain ADR-044  
**IDE Cursor Tasks:** `.cursor/rules/rimvio-cursor-task-agents.mdc` (개발용 — 제품 copy 금지)

> 복잡한 실행 = **Workspace Operator**. 탐색 = World Explore. 비교 = Simulate. 검수 = Verify. 좁은 사실 = Domain Quick.

| Capability role | Surface | Cursor analog (internal) |
|---|---|---|
| **workspace_operator** | Workspace | generalPurpose |
| **world_explore** | Globe (+ Workspace) | explore |
| **compare_simulate** | Workspace | best-of-n-runner |
| **verify_reflect** | Workspace | bugbot / security-review |
| **domain_quick** | Globe | ci / shell / guide |
| **architect_launch** | Globe | product_only |
| **field_executor** | Field | product_only |

## Do

- Judgment Chain → `capability.role` + `preferredSurface` 사용 (병렬 Runtime 금지)
- hard / planning / openWorkspace → Context Workspace Operator
- `planContextRun` consumes Capability (`peekCapabilityRouteForUtterance`) so Operator/Compare/Verify beat free-talk essay
- 사용자 카피: Trip Assistant · 작업장 — Cursor Task 이름 금지

## Don't

- `QuickAgent` / `ExploreAgent` 패키지 신설
- Globe chat essay로 hard trip을 끝내기
- Field에서 새 자원 생성
